# StrictDoc writes its output and its scaffolding into whatever folder it is
# given, so any spec folder under maintenance/ grows these the first time it is
# exported or opened. None of it is source: the export is regenerated on every
# run, and the two files at the bottom are rewritten by StrictDocStarter each
# time the project is opened.
#
# What stays tracked is the input: the spec .md files and the .sgra grammars
# beside them.

output/
__pycache__/
strictdoc_config.py
strictdoc-theme.css
